  data: {
    LLM: "Dealer deals 12 cards each and 6 to the talon. Players bid (Sechserdreier, Rufer mit Spatz/Uhu, Dreier) or say Erster; if all pass, Fahren is played. Bidder calls a King (in Rufer) or takes 3 or 6 talon cards and discards. Announcements and Kontras follow. Player to dealer's right leads; 12 tricks, follow suit, must trump if unable to follow. Highest trump wins trick, else highest of led suit. Team with 36+ of 71 card points wins the game; bonuses and game points are settled in cash.",
    Player: "Dealer deals 12 cards each and 6 to the talon. Players bid (Sechserdreier, Rufer mit Spatz/Uhu, Dreier) or say Erster; if all pass, Fahren is played. Bidder calls a King (in Rufer) or takes 3 or 6 talon cards and discards. Announcements and Kontras follow. Player to dealer's right leads; 12 tricks, follow suit, must trump if unable to follow. Highest trump wins trick, else highest of led suit. Team with 36+ of 71 card points wins the game; bonuses and game points are settled in cash.",
    objective: 'Win tricks containing valuable cards. In positive contracts, need 36+ of 71 card points. Various contracts have different objectives.',
    gameplay: "Dealer deals 12 cards each and 6 to the talon. Players bid (Sechserdreier, Rufer mit Spatz/Uhu, Dreier) or say Erster; if all pass, Fahren is played. Bidder calls a King (in Rufer) or takes 3 or 6 talon cards and discards. Announcements and Kontras follow. Player to dealer's right leads; 12 tricks, follow suit, must trump if unable to follow. Highest trump wins trick, else highest of led suit. Team with 36+ of 71 card points wins the game; bonuses and game points are settled in cash.",
    keyRules: [
      'Deal 12 cards each and 6 to the talon in two packets of 3; deal and play anticlockwise.',
      'Bid Sechserdreier, Rufer mit Spatz/Uhu, or Dreier, or say Erster; if all pass, Fahren is played.',
      'In Rufer, call a King for partner; bidder takes 3 talon cards (or 6 in Sechserdreier) and discards; 5-point cards and most trumps cannot be discarded.',
      "Follow suit; must trump if unable to follow. Highest Tarock wins trick, else highest of led suit. Player to dealer's right leads.",
      '36+ of 71 card points wins the game; game points and bonuses (Trull, Four Kings, Pagat Ultimo, Uhu, King Ultimo, Valat) settled in cash.',
